-- run-mode companion to
-- witness-metavar-goal-accepts-any-proposition.kp.  `bogus` forges
-- (=) True False out of thin air via `witness` (its implicit goal is
-- still a metavariable when inserted, and the pending goal is
-- silently dropped); `subst` then transports () : Unit along the
-- forged proof through the `discr` family to inhabit Void, and main
